<title>TURKEY: Turkish stock index hits record high at 75,584.</title>
<headline>Turkish stock index hits record high at 75,584.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish stock market index hit an all-time high of 75,584.08 at the close of the morning trading on Thursday after breaking resistance at 73,000, brokers said.</p>
<p>The trade volume was 14.6 trillion lira, of which 4.05 trillion lira was wholesale market sales, they said.</p>
